 * numeric tokens after # (e.g. #42@x) violate the grammar. Parsers
 * must reject the offending entry with a precise diagnostic and not
 * abort the whole file. The other ANCHOR entries (well-formed) and
 * the entire DATA section should be successfully recovered. */
ISO-10303-21;
